# Boron 2P with its p electron in the complex m=+1 orbital, in a
# magnetic field B=-0.05 along z, with TPSS. The kinetic energy density is
# current corrected, tau - |j_p|^2/(2 rho), which makes the meta-GGA
# gauge invariant; without the correction a meta-GGA was refused in a
# field. E(+B)-E(-B) = -B (M_L + 2 M_S) = -0.1 holds as for LDA, as the
# Zeeman term is a constant within a symmetry block.
System B.xyz
Basis cc-pVDZ
Method mgga_x_tpss-mgga_c_tpss
Multiplicity 2
Restricted false
ComplexBasis true
LinearOccupations -1
LinearOccupationFile complex_orbs_b_ml.linocc
LinearB -0.05
JKMethod Cholesky
DFTGrid 75 -302
ConvThr 1e-7
SaveChk complex_orbs_b_tpss_ml_m.chk
